# ray_of_command.txt: SP$ Untap, then DB$ GainControl | AddKWs$ Haste |
# LoseControl$ EOT, then DB$ DelayedTrigger | Mode$ ChangesController |
# ValidCard$ Card.IsTriggerRemembered | ValidOriginalController$ You. At cleanup
# the EOT command ends the control change (PhaseHandler.java:406), which fires
# the delayed trigger (CR 514.3a gives it priority in a repeated cleanup step):
# Defined$ DelayTriggerRememberedLKI taps the Bears, back on the AI's side.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue targets 6
castspell human 1
resolvestack
advance 9
resolvestack
